21	/**
22	 * Raised when an owner submitted to the create endpoint has one or more required fields that are
23	 * present but blank (whitespace-only), which Bean Validation's {@code @Size(min = 1)} constraint
24	 * does not catch. Carries the names of the offending fields so the {@code ExceptionControllerAdvice}
25	 * can report them in the {@code errors} array of a 400 response.
26	 */
